      en: ["Södertälje was granted its first city charter in the year 1370.", "The Södertälje Canal was officially completed and opened in 1819.", "Scania AB employs approximately 15,000 workers within Södertälje.", "AstraZeneca operates one of the world's largest pill factories here.", "Tom Tits Experiment was established as a science museum in 1987.", "The lock in Södertälje measures 135 meters long and 17 meters wide."],
