      en: ["Founded in 1652 by Count Per Brahe", "Polkagris candy invented in 1859", "Birthplace of explorer S. A. Andrée", "Main hub for ferries to Visingsö island", "Brahehus ruins overlook Lake Vättern", "Located in the province of Småland"],
