      en: ["Located on an island northeast of Stockholm", "Home to the Millesgården sculpture park", "Host of the world's largest cross-country race", "Historical headquarters of the AGA company", "Connected to the mainland via Lidingöbron", "One of the wealthiest municipalities in Sweden"],
